# Suspicious Response File Execution Via Odbcconf.EXE | T1218.008 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_odbcconf_response_file_susp.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image="*\\odbcconf.exe" OR OriginalFileName="odbcconf.exe") (CommandLine="* -f *" OR CommandLine="* /f *" OR CommandLine="* –f *" OR CommandLine="* —f *" OR CommandLine="* ―f *") NOT (CommandLine="*.rsp*" OR (ParentImage="C:\\Windows\\System32\\runonce.exe" Image="C:\\Windows\\System32\\odbcconf.exe" CommandLine="*.exe /E /F \"C:\\WINDOWS\\system32\\odbcconf.tmp\"*"))
